      "writtenOn": "2023-10-20T08:39:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The initialization time for VehicleManager_Fuzzer is approximately 100 milliseconds. Therefore, using LLVMFuzzerInitialize() will not speed up the fuzzer. VehicleManager_fuzzer calls WatchdogClient::initialize(), which utilizes AServiceManager_getService(). AServiceManager_getService() is a deprecated function and is a part of the libbinder_ndk library. AServiceManager_getService() polls for 5 seconds, and due to this polling time, the execution speed of the fuzzer is slow. Furthermore, the fuzzer is using the lib64 version of libbinder_ndk, making it device-dependent and beyond our control from within the fuzzer.",
      "parentUuid": "0a83ebd4_24f2017f",
      "revId": "213e8bba850888b23bcd5a9eb5fc2ca004a00c09",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
